{"obsah":"<p>Lipno is a paradise for bikers and holidaymakers. Lukáš Valný and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček went to the opening of the local cycle path, which connects to an extensive network of trails around Lipno, not only for bikers. Interesting surroundings, a live concert and spectators who love bikes. The ideal combination. On the way we also stopped at the Blindur races organised by Michal Prokop. When we can't make it as riders, at least we can be spectators for a moment :)</p>\n\n<p>photo by #jelenvolevriji</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF9139_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF9139_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246100\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF9143_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF9143_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246099\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF9148_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF9148_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246098\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FDSCF915